      "line_start": 71,
      "line_end": 77,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line": 71,
          "text": "`policy.json` separately records actual host username/nodename/UID and the chosen"
        },
        {
          "line": 72,
          "text": "embedded build identity. The latter is labelled build metadata and never used"
        },
        {
          "line": 73,
          "text": "as evidence of a second host. Until actual full kernel builds, byte comparison"
        },
        {
          "line": 74,
          "text": "and QEMU boots pass, a successful native tiny fixture proves only the adapter"
        },
        {
          "line": 75,
          "text": "mechanism. No cross-host, hardware or arbitrary-environment reproducibility is"
        },
        {
          "line": 76,
          "text": "claimed. The forced fresh target also avoids claiming incremental-cache"
        },
        {
          "line": 77,
          "text": "correctness for compiler environment overrides."
        }
      ]
